# Per-developer cargo config (e.g. China rsproxy.cn mirror).
# Repo-level .cargo/config.toml forces the mirror on CI/non-CN devs and breaks
# GitHub-hosted Windows runners (rsproxy.cn flaky from US/EU). Set in
# ~/.cargo/config.toml (user-level) instead.
.cargo/

